{
 "about": "Post records from every list surface (appendix A 16-19, 26, 50) and the two field normalizers. raw is one item as the surface sends it; context is what the caller knows (the blog a list belongs to); expect is the record in the skill's terms, or null when the item is not a post. Times are KST, minute precision. labels: what Naver said about the post — private, buddy-only, mutual-only, own-money (the writer set Naver's own-money flag; not the same as a title or tag saying 내돈내산). A count Naver did not send is null, never 0. Expected stamps come from datetime with a fixed +09:00 zone. feed rows follow the planning-session field list (likeCount, commentCount, buyWithMyOwnMoney) and are recalibrated against P2 captures.",
